deId":732060101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"Affan","textMapHash":3381575282,"text":"Oh, it's you.","nextNodeIds":[732060102]},{"nodeId":732060102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2885721714,"text":"How are the seeds doing?","nextNodeIds":[732060103]},{"nodeId":732060103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"Affan","textMapHash":3783396138,"text":"None of them have sprouted yet.","nextNodeIds":[732060104]},{"nodeId":732060104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"Affan","textMapHash":123130618,"text":"I've checked the surface of the seeds, and there's not even the slightest hint of germination.","nextNodeIds":[732060105]},{"nodeId":732060105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"Affan","textMapHash":2715206330,"text":"Why is that?","nextNodeIds":[732060106]},{"nodeId":732060106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"Affan","textMapHash":1359683154,"text":"I'm sure these are the right seeds. I found them in the storeroom based on the old ghost's notes.","nextNodeIds":[732060107]},{"nodeId":732060107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"Affan","textMapHash":3044512618,"text":"According to his notes, the seeds have a long shelf life, and they won't ever go bad so long as they're kept dry.","nextNodeIds":[732060108]},{"nodeId":732060108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"Affan","textMapHash":2629812138,"text":"And there shouldn't be any problems with the way I planted them either. I watered and fertilized them as I should... So why?","nextNodeIds":[732060109]},{"nodeId":732060109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1522778810,"text":"Don't worry. Why don't we wait a little longer, Grandpa Affan?","nextNodeIds":[732060110]},{"nodeId":732060110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3215548586,"text":"Every time the two of us go to pick fruits and flowers in the wild, we have to wait several days for them to grow back after we pick 'em up.","nextNodeIds":[732060111,732060112]},{"nodeId":732060111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":415016554,"text":"Be patient.","nextNodeIds":[732060113]},{"nodeId":732060113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"Affan","textMapHash":178532898,"text":"Ah, I suppose I will just have to wait. Do you guys have time today? Can you help me water them again?","nextNodeIds":[732060114]},{"nodeId":732060114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"Affan","textMapHash":145641978,"text":"It took me hours to loosen the soil in the nursery and I'm too tired to run back for water.","nextNodeIds":[732060115]},{"nodeId":732060115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2718764394,"text":"Got it.","nextNodeIds":[732060116]},{"nodeId":732060116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"Affan","textMapHash":287130226,"text":"Thank you.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":732060112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3033616890,"text":"Keep watering them.","nextNodeIds":[732060113]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7320601,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["4233"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7320602,"order":5,"stepDescrip